逃脱计划\", \"content\": \"你们整理线索并制定逃脱计划。用于测试多项效果连续执行。\", \"isStart\": false, \"nodeKey\": \"g_ch6_escape_plan\", \"nodeType\": \"NORMAL\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:19:17\", \"positionX\": 1328.63, \"positionY\": -183.41, \"projectId\": 17, \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:35:48\"}, {\"id\": 43, \"scene\": \"黎明甲板\", \"title\": \"吉奥多线 CHAPTER 7：因为你很重要\", \"content\": \"真相即将揭开，最终选择将由线索、风险和关系状态共同决定。\", \"isStart\": false, \"nodeKey\": \"g_ch7_important\", \"nodeType\": \"NORMAL\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:20:25\", \"positionX\": 1608.05, \"positionY\": -171.56, \"projectId\": 17, \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:36:18\"}, {\"id\": 44, \"scene\": \"隐蔽船舱\", \"title\": \"吉奥多线 ANOTHER ENDING：被吉奥多囚禁\", \"content\": \"错误判断导致行动受限。本结局用于测试中途分支结局与回放。\", \"isStart\": false, \"nodeKey\": \"g_another_captive\", \"nodeType\": \"ENDING\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:21:40\", \"positionX\": 777.41, \"positionY\": 241.45, \"projectId\": 17, \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:29:23\"}, {\"id\": 45, \"scene\": \"暴风甲板\", \"title\": \"吉奥多线 毁灭 BAD ENDING\", \"content\": \"风险失控，调查失败。本结局用于验证坏结局路径和问题反馈。\", \"isStart\": false, \"nodeKey\": \"g_bad_stab\", \"nodeType\": \"ENDING\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:22:28\", \"positionX\": 1384.43, \"positionY\": 185.85, \"projectId\": 17, \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:35:22\"}, {\"id\": 46, \"scene\": \"港口\", \"title\": \"吉奥多线 GOOD ENDING\", \"content\": \"你们化解危机，但仍有未解开的心意。本结局用于验证条件达成后的普通成功结局。\", \"isStart\": false, \"nodeKey\": \"g_good_lovers\", \"nodeType\": \"ENDING\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:23:24\", \"positionX\": 1906.22, \"positionY\": -336.08, \"projectId\": 17, \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:36:15\"}, {\"id\": 47, \"scene\": \"重获平静的甲板\", \"title\": \"吉奥多线 HAPPY ENDING\", \"content\": \"线索、信任与关键物品都已满足，航程迎来圆满收束。本结局用于验证复合条件。\", \"isStart\": false, \"nodeKey\": \"g_happy_special\", \"nodeType\": \"ENDING\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-14T21:23:53\", \"positionX\": 1910.26, \"positionY\": -58.65, \"projectId\": 17, \"updatedAt\": \"202